  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder (config_033) achieve high accuracy (0.713). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with the more powerful imagenet_vit_l image encoder while using avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion. It isolates the impact of the image encoder, a critical component, and evaluates whether the stronger encoder compensates for the simpler aggregation method, providing insight into which design choice (encoder or aggregation) has greater influence on performance."
